span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\">에서 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\">2023</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\">년 제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\">회 학술대회를 개최합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\">이와 더불어 대학원생 및 신진연구자를 위한 세션을 다음과 같이 마련하오니</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\">관심 있는 분들의 많은 참여를 부탁드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\">.</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:220%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;mso-font-width:98%;letter-spacing:-0.2pt;font-size:11.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">신청 자격 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">국내외 대학원에 재학 중인 자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">수료생 포함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:220%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">신청 주제 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: 4·3</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">과 관련한 자유주제</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:220%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">신청 방법 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">첨부된 신청서를 작성하여 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">13</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">) 18</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">시까지 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">“4·3 </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">융합전공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">”</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">으로 제출</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:220%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">발표자 선정 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">신청서 심사 후</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">, 10</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">20</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, s